          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Penetrating sealers give five to ten years on a real driveway, acrylics two to four, and no warranty on a tin changes those numbers. Salt, sun, tyres and prep decide where inside those ranges you land.
          </p>
